{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261112/photo/bkn-20261112191342808-1112_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261112215335\"/><p>今晚(12日)攪珠的今年第120期六合彩，攪珠結果為20、24、33、37、42、46，特別號碼13。頭獎1注中，每注派彩21,273,760港元；二獎4.5注中，每注派彩548,000港元；三獎79注中，每注派83,240港元。</p><p>下期六合彩將於周日(15日)晚上9時30分攪珠，估計頭獎基金為8,000,000港元。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T14:03:56.086393+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T11:13:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T14:37:18.900082+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T13:57:20.961622+00:00","content_hash":"a915cc6bd5fe74997807b7c419d92e9b971cf6efa6a49a2cd9a379d314778081","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}